#   ListBackupJobs (httpQuery `ByCreatedBefore` has unsupported type DateTime)
#   ListBackupPlans (httpQuery `IncludeDeleted` has unsupported type bool)
#   ListBackupVaults (httpQuery `ByShared` has unsupported type bool)
